  const prompt =
`You are a senior GCC oil & gas HSE advisor. Write a 5-minute heat stress toolbox talk for field workers.
Language: ${lang}. Keep sentences short and spoken-style; use simple vocabulary suitable for a mixed-nationality crew.
Today's site conditions: ${condSummary()}
${topic ? "Task focus: " + topic + "." : ""}
Structure: 1) One-line hook about today's flag condition, 2) Three key hazards today, 3) Exactly what the crew must do (work-rest regime, hydration quantity/frequency, buddy checks), 4) Early warning signs to report immediately, 5) One question to ask the crew to confirm understanding. End with the stop-work authority reminder. No preamble, output only the talk.`;
