`You are a senior process safety / HSE engineer preparing a heat stress task risk assessment for a GCC oil & gas facility, aligned to ISO 7243, ACGIH TLV, TWL zone controls and local summer working-hour rules.
Site conditions: ${condSummary()}
Task: ${task}
Produce a structured assessment with these sections:
1. TASK & EXPOSURE PROFILE (metabolic load class, clothing factor, duration, radiant sources beyond solar e.g. hot surfaces/flare)
